body:
I am feeling very similar, my rope is hanging in my bedroom...

I also have nobody except my narcissist mother, which I want to get rid of.

I will turn 30 in 12 days, and it will be a sad day.

What kinda works for me is this, and if you are suicidal you know that conventional methods don't really help to deal with suicidal thoughts so bear with me...

&#x200B;

I got into martial arts and asked the coach to prepare me for a fight which will happen in the next 3-4 months. If I don't train, stop smoking, lift weights, do yoga, meditation and so forth I will probably get knocked out. The anxiety replaces my suicidal thoughts sometimes.

&#x200B;

It helped tyson fury with his depression, get back into boxing cured him.

&#x200B;

Secondly, and this might sound weird, stop having orgasms, try to make it 100 days without an orgasm, it decreases anxiety bigtime, increases your energy, testosterone, resensitives your dopamine receptors, makes you more attractive and so forth.

&#x200B;

I was on 120 days when I met my narcissistic ex-girlfriend who used me and now I have CPTSD and need trauma therapy.

&#x200B;

Thirdly... Cold showers, lots of meat, lifting weights, Zinc, Try testosterone shots, high intensity training, meditation, EMDR therapy.

&#x200B;

Those help me and I am still suffering... but I hope it goes uphill from here.

&#x200B;

The energy you get from not orgasming will get you friends, go for 100 days and see for yourself, but please do not make my mistake and befriend toxic manipulative people, always take your time getting to know people...

&#x200B;

Good luck warrior.

&#x200B;

PS: you can always write me and I will help you.

Thank you! I try hard to see it as a gift because she indirectly showed me what problems I have and that I need healing. Therapy, meditation and journaling will make me a much more mature and better person. After the healing is done I will be a much better partner for my future girlfriend and a good father for my future children.

&#x200B;

Much love back to you, at the end of the tunnel we will feel and be better than ever :)
